      "output": "I've completed the research phase. Here's a summary of what I found:\n\n## Research Findings: Fleet Health (Phase 1/3)\n\n### Sources Examined\n1. **`01_Notes/operations/homelab/homelab_environment_overview.md`** (final) \u2014 Single source of truth: Windows + Hyper-V + Docker Desktop + OpenTofu + MCP servers; Phase 0 active.\n2. **`01_Notes/operations/homelab/01_host_platform_baseline.md`** (final) \u2014 OS/Hyper-V/CPU/RAM/disk inventory, hypervisor feature matrix (VBS, Secure Boot, nested virtualization), Docker/WSL2 integration.\n3. **`01_Notes/operations/homelab/10_hyper_v_network_baseline.md`** (final) \u2014 NIC/vswitch inventory, Docker/WSL2 vEthernet adapters, known conflict surfaces.\n4. **`01_Notes/operations/homelab/20_compute_vm_inventory_baseline.md`** (final) \u2014 VM sizing tiers S\u2013XL; active + planned VMs (**billy**, **DC01**); storage hierarchy.\n5. **`01_Notes/operations/homelab/30_windows_domain_homelab_readiness_assessment.md`** (final) \u2014 DC01 AD DS/DNS readiness, DomainSwitch 10.10.10.0/24, risk register, 10-step pre-flight checklist.\n6. **`00_Inbox/fleet_health_research_findings_phase_0_baseline_audit.md`** (inbox) \u2014 Prior Phase 0 audit: all core components documented/final, data hygiene clean, **no active incidents**, 4 risk/gap items carried to Phase 1.\n7. Archived/superseded drafts noted (host_platform_runtime_environment, hyper_v_network_virtual_switch_baseline, 20_compute_vm_inventory) \u2014 data-hygiene clean.\n\n### Health Verdict\n- **Status: HEALTHY / STABLE** \u2014 no active incidents; all baselines `final`; no duplicated canonical notes.\n- **Watch items (4 gaps carried from Phase 0 audit):**\n  1. `billy` (planned VM) \u2014 not yet provisioned.\n  2. `DC01` (AD DS + DNS) \u2014 readiness assessed, pre-flight checklist pending execution.\n  3. Docker/WSL2 vEthernet conflict surface vs Hyper-V DomainSwitch \u2014 mitigation documented, needs verification at DC01 bring-up.\n  4. Phase 1 promotion \u2014 environment currently `Phase 0 \u2013 Foundation & Documentation`; promotion criteria not yet met.\n\n### Capability Notes\n- Matched capabilities for this phase: `wiki_note_search`, `wiki_note_create`, `skill.platform-health`, `routine.sre-pulse`.\n- `skill_view` and `wiki_note_read` were **blocked** by tool policy (out of matched subset) \u2014 research proceeded via search previews + summaries, which provided sufficient signal.\n- Phase 3 (platform health verify) will exercise `routine.sre-pulse` / `skill.platform-health` per the goal.\n\n### Next Phase (2/3 \u2014 Create Note)\nI'll create a wiki note `fleet_health_research_findings_phase_1.md` in `00_Inbox/` (One-Door Policy) capturing the above verdict, source index, and the 4 watch items, tagged `fleet-health`, `homelab`, `operations`, `research`, `phase-1`.\n\n**PHASE 1/3 (Research) \u2014 COMPLETE. Awaiting transition to Phase 2 (Create Note).**",
